null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-12-10T16:49:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T18:51:55Z","closed_at":"2026-03-30T18:51:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable.stable.steam.f62fdbde1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7628) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-3470 CPU @ 3.20GHz (4 threads) - 31.96 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen draw_multiline_string()'s width is set to -1, HorizontalAlignment flag is ignored.\n\nBased on #80163,\n> -1 is passed as the width so the exact width needed for drawing the text is used and hence there's no space left for the horizontal alignment\n\nWhile it makes sense for draw_string() that there can be no alignment if the string's full width is used, for draw_multiline_string() this appears to not be true.\n\nActual behavior with HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_CENTER, and HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT:\n\n<img width=\"189\" height=\"197\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4d81f3b-d4fd-4148-9fed-8a1326d2dff3\" />\n\nIf -1 results in the bounding box taking the full width, I can clearly see that the first line has plenty of space on the right remaining.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\n<img width=\"164\" height=\"195\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd6a23dd-06c8-4a75-aaad-841e9a6a8653\" />\n\nWorkaround:\n\n```gdscript\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*4), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT,\n\tfont.get_multiline_string_size(\"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, get_theme_default_font_size()).x,\n)\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*5), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_CENTER,\n\tfont.get_multiline_string_size(\"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_CENTER, -1, get_theme_default_font_size()).x,\n)\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*6), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT,\n\tfont.get_multiline_string_size(\"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT, -1, get_theme_default_font_size()).x,\n)\n```\n\nIf -1 means taking the full width of the text area, then alignment should see the bounding box. If -1 means that width is just not calculated (and cropping remains disabled), it feels kind of counterintuitive.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*1), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1)\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*2), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_CENTER, -1)\ndraw_multiline_string(font, Vector2(32, 60*3), \"GODOT\\nGODOTGODOT\", HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT, -1)\n```\n\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24083174/bug-demo.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"